<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson rockets 12 pct on H1.</title>
<headline>Ericsson rockets 12 pct on H1.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in telecoms group AB LM Ericsson leapt more than 10 percent after its first half earnings were released showing a 44 percent jump in pre-tax profits compared to the same 1996 period.</p>
<p>The share touched a high of 369 crowns, up 40 crowns or 12 percent on Wedneday's close, but by 0910 GMT was trading at 363 crowns, up 34 crowns.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
